---
// Where the app lived until it moved to the root. Links to it are still out
// there, shared mixes among them, so this sends them on with their query and
// hash intact: #mix= is the whole mix. A hash never reaches a server, so a
// static redirect couldn't carry it. An installed copy never gets here: its
// service worker answers /app/ with a redirect itself (see sw.ts).
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://murmur.umaru.dev/" />
    <title>Murmur</title>
    <script is:inline>
      location.replace("/" + location.search + location.hash)
    </script>
    <noscript><meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/" /></noscript>
  </head>
</html>
